@startuml
title Component Diagram - Here4U

' ========= COMPONENTS =========
component "Mobile App (Android)" as App
component "Firebase Authentication" as Auth
component "Firestore Database" as Firestore
component "Cloud Functions\n(Serverless Backend)" as Functions
component "AI Summarizer Service" as AI
component "Push Notifications\n(FCM)" as FCM
component "External Emergency Services\n(Contacts / Hotlines)" as Emergency

' ========= RELATIONSHIPS =========
App --> Auth : Login / Password check
App --> Firestore : CRUD on user data\n(journals, emotions, streaks, summaries)

FCM --> App : Deliver reminders & streak notifications
App --> Emergency : Trigger emergency button (dial/SMS)

Firestore <..> Functions : Trigger-based updates\n(streak calculation only)
Functions --> FCM : Send push notifications

App --> AI : Request summaries directly\n(save results back in Firestore)

@enduml
